{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1912","published":"2026-04-17T11:10:55Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:55.370580789Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-4105"],"summary":"systemd security update","details":"systemd is a system and service manager that runs as PID 1 and starts the rest of the system.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in systemd. The systemd-machined service contains an Improper Access Control vulnerability due to insufficient validation of the class parameter in the RegisterMachine D-Bus (Desktop Bus) method. A local unprivileged user can exploit this by attempting to register a machine with a specific class value, which may leave behind a usable, attacker-controlled machine object. This allows the attacker to invoke methods on the privileged object, leading to the execution of arbitrary commands with root privileges on the host system.(CVE-2026-4105)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"systemd","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/systemd&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"243-88.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["systemd-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-container-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-debuginfo-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-debugsource-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-devel-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-journal-remote-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-libs-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-udev-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","systemd-udev-compat-243-88.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["systemd-help-243-88.oe2003sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["systemd-243-88.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["systemd-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-container-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-debuginfo-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-debugsource-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-devel-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-journal-remote-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-libs-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-udev-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","systemd-udev-compat-243-88.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1912.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-1912"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-4105"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"Medium"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H"}]}